{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（30 日）下午1時44分，九龍塘范信達道4-6號真能閣一個單位，疑抽油煙機起火。消防員到場迅速將火種撲熄，一名外籍女傭不適送往伊利沙伯醫院治理。</p><figure><img alt=\"現場是廣播道范信達道真能閣一個單位。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260530/1137406624605147136543982.jpeg/5jRTzwfxsx95UdhrRZr4q0b16akW1f6T1FaFNdRWhTU\"/><figcaption>現場是廣播道范信達道真能閣一個單位。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"現場是廣播道范信達道真能閣一個單位。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260530/1137406622214262784602391.jpeg/ABCQtKJTPvLCMe19rEjnueIvpRw2hhIR4U0hDuFNIQ4\"/><figcaption>現場是廣播道范信達道真能閣一個單位。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"一名外籍家傭不適送院。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260530/1137406619978567680508143.jpeg/DuWKI_Lt-vKCkUYwxWAj0W4oqA4ZW851IbhXhyG4V4c\"/><figcaption>一名外籍家傭不適送院。</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-05-30T07:22:23.510065+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":125,"images":3,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none"}}